# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

This application was created from the deterministic Vellum `basic` template.
Application behavior belongs in `src/`; generated design material belongs in
`ui/generated/` and should not be hand-edited.

```sh
vellum doctor --fix
vellum build
vellum run
vellum test
vellum capture --scenario smoke --output artifacts/smoke.png
vellum package --output dist
```

When created by the native macOS SDK, the initial build and smoke scenario have
already passed. SDKs without that capability and unsupported targets report
`capability_unavailable`; that is an error, not a successful no-op.
